{"flow": "implementation-commit", "desc": "实施提交: 核对授权范围, 作者写完成记录, 然后循环 \"候选检查, 一轮审核, 处置, 收尾\", 直到收尾核对通过并提交.", "entry": "scope", "returns": {"committed": "已提交", "reclassify": "授权范围调整后回到暂存与分类", "nothing": "没有改动", "cancelled": "用户停止"}}
{"id": "scope", "type": "program", "desc": "授权 issue 来自实例关联的 Artifact; 新进入终态的 issue 必须都在授权范围内且属于同一 effort.", "primitive": "commitAudit.authorizingScope", "args": {}, "next": {"ok": "measure", "out-of-scope": "ask-scope"}, "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#9", "skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#10"]}
{"id": "ask-scope", "type": "waitUser", "desc": "Gate 1 的范围问题由用户处理.", "next": {"retry": "return:reclassify", "stop": "return:cancelled"}, "question": "候选使授权范围外或其他 effort 的 issue 进入终态. 请调整授权或候选后重试, 或停止.", "options": ["retry", "stop"], "context": ["$result.scope.diagnostics"], "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#10"]}
{"id": "measure", "type": "program", "desc": "先算出净增摘要与下一个 ADR 编号, 交给作者写进 Validation.", "primitive": "commitAudit.measure", "args": {}, "next": {"measured": "records"}, "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#13"]}
{"id": "records", "type": "agent", "desc": "一个请求完成完成记录, 自查和提交说明; 可以并入实施流程的最后一个 Agent 步骤.", "work": "author", "next": {"ready": "candidate", "ask-user:stop": "return:cancelled"}, "write": {"scope": "instance"}, "instruction": "更新授权 issue 的完成记录, 然后自查并起草提交说明. (1) 只根据已完成的工作设置 `Status: completed` 并勾选已满足的验收项, 不改它们的文字; 新要求, 范围变化, 用户例外或验收文字变化不是完成记录, 遇到时交用户. (2) `## Validation` 为每条验收标准写具体证据 (测试, 命令, 文件或检查), 并原样写入输入中的候选摘要块; 一个 issue 分多次提交时把各次数字相加. (3) 自查: 没有重新实现已有公共辅助函数; 无死代码, 文件内部导出已去掉; 测试名与断言相符; 发现即改. (4) 提交说明遵循 Conventional Commits 1.0.0, 用户可见功能 `feat`, 缺陷 `fix`, 破坏性变更加 `!` 或 `BREAKING CHANGE:` 尾注, 描述简短, 祈使语气, 只有理由或取舍不明显时写正文.", "inputs": ["$result.measure.summary", "$state.authorizingIssues"], "output": {"branch": ["ready", "ask-user"], "fields": {"commitMessage": "string", "question": "string?"}}, "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#1", "skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#2", "skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#13", "skills/code-review/result-reuse.md#6", "skills/commit/SKILL.md#6"]}
{"id": "candidate", "type": "call", "desc": "暂存并跑审核前的确定性检查与预检提示.", "call": "candidate-checks", "next": {"ready": "audit", "nothing": "return:nothing", "stopped": "return:cancelled"}}
{"id": "audit", "type": "call", "desc": "冻结候选, 跑一轮 Commit Audit 和完整验证.", "call": "audit-round", "next": {"all-clear": "close", "findings": "handle", "error": "ask-retry"}}
{"id": "handle", "type": "call", "desc": "作者处置本轮问题与失败, 必要时质疑 Reviewer, 改 spec 或重做 Spec Readiness.", "call": "handle-findings", "next": {"done": "close", "incomplete": "ask-retry", "stopped": "return:cancelled"}}
{"id": "close", "type": "call", "desc": "核对最终暂存树相对受审树只有记录差异, 核对 subject, 然后提交.", "call": "close-and-commit", "next": {"committed": "return:committed", "needs-round": "repair-check", "subject-stale": "subject", "hook-failed": "handle", "error": "ask-retry", "nothing": "return:nothing", "stopped": "return:cancelled"}, "requiresBefore": ["barrier-freeze", "formalGate"], "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#7", "skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#8", "skills/commit/SKILL.md#7"]}
{"id": "repair-check", "type": "call", "desc": "下一轮之前, 判断模型提示修复是否没解决某条发现.", "call": "repair-check", "next": {"clear": "candidate", "flagged": "handle"}}
{"id": "subject", "type": "call", "desc": "subject 在就绪记录之后变了: 增量 Spec Readiness.", "call": "spec-readiness", "args": {"issueId": "$state.subjectIssue", "mode": "incremental"}, "next": {"satisfied": "close", "cancelled": "return:cancelled"}, "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#8"]}
{"id": "ask-retry", "type": "waitUser", "desc": "prepare 失败, verify 报错或 Reviewer `incomplete` 都在这里交用户.", "next": {"retry": "candidate", "stop": "return:cancelled"}, "question": "冻结, 收尾核对或审核未能完成 (见背景), 本轮作废. 处理原因后重开一轮, 或停止.", "options": ["retry", "stop"], "context": ["$state.lastError", "$state.incompleteReasons"], "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#4"]}
